WEBVTT

00:20.020 --> 00:23.340
♪Chasing wind, I set out afar♪

00:23.580 --> 00:26.820
♪The road ahead lost, my voice unheard♪

00:27.020 --> 00:28.940
♪I've tasted joy and sorrow♪

00:29.100 --> 00:32.460
♪Laying low, I plan every move♪

00:32.660 --> 00:35.980
♪With a mortal heart and lingering ties♪

00:36.180 --> 00:37.900
♪I'm roaming far and wide♪

00:38.260 --> 00:41.540
♪A twist of fate in desperate times♪

00:41.820 --> 00:45.060
♪A bond that outlives the dust of life♪

00:46.340 --> 00:49.740
♪Still chasing what immortality means♪

00:50.580 --> 00:55.180
♪Even eternity flashes by in a blink♪

00:59.020 --> 01:00.900
♪Don't mock my ordinary life♪

01:01.220 --> 01:04.900
♪I fight alone as chaos shakes the world♪

01:08.020 --> 01:09.940
♪Don't scorn my humble roots♪

01:10.180 --> 01:13.420
♪Kind at heart, ruthless when I must be♪

01:13.660 --> 01:15.580
♪Fate stirs with joy and grief beneath♪

01:15.820 --> 01:17.700
♪I hold the tide between life and death♪

01:18.140 --> 01:20.060
♪Faith carries me through endless dark♪

01:20.340 --> 01:22.220
♪And I return with a heart refined♪

01:26.060 --> 01:29.780
♪Forged by trial, I rise through three realms♪

01:29.780 --> 01:32.420
♪Reborn in the wheel of fate♪

01:32.420 --> 01:33.620
[The Immortal Ascension]

01:33.620 --> 01:34.820
[Adapted from the webnovel, The Immortal Ascension by Wangyu]

01:34.820 --> 01:36.020
[serialized in www.qidian.com under China Literature Limited]

01:36.060 --> 01:38.980
[Episode 28]

01:47.360 --> 01:48.260
Up there!

02:05.320 --> 02:06.050
It's Demonic Flame Sect's

02:06.200 --> 02:07.090
Skyfire Spell.

02:07.640 --> 02:09.020
Each drop of lava

02:09.390 --> 02:11.130
hits like a Foundation Stage strike.

02:11.560 --> 02:12.940
Everyone, defend together!

02:22.320 --> 02:22.980
Hold your ground.

02:23.360 --> 02:24.260
With the Mist of Camouflage up,

02:24.510 --> 02:26.170
they won't be able to track us.

02:26.470 --> 02:27.540
They'll leave soon.

03:20.720 --> 03:21.970
Just as I expected.

03:46.120 --> 03:47.050
Li Huayuan

03:47.400 --> 03:48.210
greets Grandmaster.

03:48.440 --> 03:49.170
Huayuan.

03:50.120 --> 03:50.580
Come over.

03:52.120 --> 03:53.210
Sit and have some tea.

03:54.350 --> 03:55.450
No need for tea.

03:55.840 --> 03:56.730
My Senior Hongfu...

03:59.640 --> 04:00.260
Grandmaster...

04:03.190 --> 04:04.610
Was that person just here?

04:05.790 --> 04:07.380
You're a clever man.

04:09.600 --> 04:10.820
Why bother asking?

04:15.670 --> 04:16.580
Then I'll take my leave.

04:21.510 --> 04:22.260
Huayuan.

04:22.910 --> 04:24.170
Do you remember

04:25.230 --> 04:27.300
the first lesson I gave you

04:28.280 --> 04:29.770
when you joined the sect?

04:31.040 --> 04:31.650
I do.

04:33.280 --> 04:35.540
The highest state of cultivation

04:36.670 --> 04:38.330
is absolute detachment.

04:39.070 --> 04:39.980
It lies in

04:40.350 --> 04:41.650
letting go of desire.

04:42.440 --> 04:43.380
It lies in

04:44.120 --> 04:46.380
learning to give up.

04:46.720 --> 04:47.580
It lies in...

04:48.190 --> 04:49.140
I remember it all.

04:50.400 --> 04:51.020
I also remember

04:51.160 --> 04:53.050
another thing you once told me.

04:53.950 --> 04:56.260
If you can't even clear your own thoughts,

04:56.950 --> 04:58.770
what's the point of cultivating at all?

04:59.440 --> 05:00.540
Exactly.

05:00.840 --> 05:02.450
Yet after all I said,

05:03.630 --> 05:05.610
you didn't take in a word, did you?

05:05.840 --> 05:07.380
If you had,

05:07.880 --> 05:08.700
would we

05:09.320 --> 05:11.210
be under siege like this?

05:11.670 --> 05:12.700
Your criticism is fair, Grandmaster.

05:14.040 --> 05:16.140
Sacrifice a little

05:17.230 --> 05:18.210
to preserve

05:18.400 --> 05:20.100
our sect.

05:20.720 --> 05:21.980
It's the best

05:22.280 --> 05:24.770
we can do now.

05:25.280 --> 05:26.300
Do you

05:26.840 --> 05:28.860
have a better plan?

05:32.070 --> 05:32.770
No, of course not.

05:35.750 --> 05:38.650
This strategy truly took everything.

05:39.070 --> 05:40.450
It's brilliant and exhausting.

05:41.320 --> 05:43.330
I couldn't have pulled it off.

05:45.320 --> 05:46.330
That tongue of yours...

05:47.440 --> 05:48.700
You think

05:49.470 --> 05:50.730
I can't hear

05:50.750 --> 05:53.260
the sarcasm in your voice?

05:55.520 --> 05:56.260
Grandmaster,

05:57.960 --> 05:58.970
I just want to know

06:00.350 --> 06:01.180
one thing.

06:01.280 --> 06:02.700
Does my Senior Hongfu

06:03.350 --> 06:05.020
and my disciple Han Li

06:05.400 --> 06:06.290
know about this?

06:09.910 --> 06:10.580
Well...

06:13.870 --> 06:16.260
Then I'll ask Senior Hongfu myself.

06:17.160 --> 06:18.180
Let's see

06:18.760 --> 06:19.740
if she's willing.

06:27.470 --> 06:31.330
You handed her over to Yunlu!

06:32.470 --> 06:33.620
That fiend

06:34.430 --> 06:36.140
slaughters innocents

06:36.520 --> 06:38.450
and plans to destroy Yellow Maple Valley!

06:39.350 --> 06:40.970
If she falls into his hands,

06:42.160 --> 06:44.290
she'll die before she gives in!

06:44.870 --> 06:46.530
It was a trade.

06:47.470 --> 06:49.330
Not a betrayal.

06:59.910 --> 07:00.700
Thanks for clarifying, Grandmaster.

08:07.520 --> 08:08.850
Their main force is Mid Foundation cultivators.

08:09.400 --> 08:10.820
A few are early stage.

08:11.310 --> 08:12.410
What rotten luck!

08:12.760 --> 08:14.020
We ran into the elites.

08:14.990 --> 08:16.060
But the real trouble

08:16.550 --> 08:17.740
are the two leading them.

08:20.400 --> 08:21.740
Hongfu of Yellow Maple Valley is here.

08:22.640 --> 08:24.260
Who wishes to face me?

08:26.040 --> 08:28.740
Oh, I thought you'd be some sweet young lady.

08:29.400 --> 08:31.140
But you're already so old.

08:32.160 --> 08:33.090
And not even

08:33.280 --> 08:34.380
that good-looking.

08:34.520 --> 08:35.210
Right?

08:36.600 --> 08:38.290
Your figure's not much either.

08:38.720 --> 08:39.890
What on earth

08:40.200 --> 08:41.260
does the Grandmaster see in you?

08:43.670 --> 08:44.890
You insolent fool!

08:49.790 --> 08:50.530
Ms,

08:51.400 --> 08:53.380
always rushing to fight

08:54.200 --> 08:55.290
the moment we meet.

08:55.470 --> 08:56.580
That's a nasty habit!

08:57.670 --> 08:59.260
Two Core cultivators.

09:00.230 --> 09:00.940
I am

09:01.040 --> 09:02.210
from the Ghost Spirit Sect.

09:03.080 --> 09:04.890
They call me Skull.

09:06.230 --> 09:07.700
You seem to be in a hurry.

09:08.310 --> 09:09.850
Where are you headed?

09:11.600 --> 09:14.020
I can sense Fu Yunzi's aura on you.

09:14.870 --> 09:16.140
You mean that old Daoist?

09:17.280 --> 09:18.180
He turned out

09:18.310 --> 09:19.940
to be quite the worthy opponent.

09:21.670 --> 09:22.740
In that case,

09:24.280 --> 09:25.450
this item...

09:26.870 --> 09:27.940
Mentor Fu Yunzi's relic!

09:28.670 --> 09:30.140
I now return it to you!

09:38.310 --> 09:39.140
For returning

09:39.280 --> 09:40.940
a fallen friend's keepsake,

09:42.910 --> 09:43.940
I'll overlook

09:44.470 --> 09:45.890
your earlier offense.

09:46.960 --> 09:48.820
But I'm taking these disciples.

09:49.230 --> 09:50.500
I hope you two

09:51.080 --> 09:51.820
won't stop me.

09:54.310 --> 09:55.210
You dumb woman,

09:55.230 --> 09:57.290
are you slow in the head?

09:57.790 --> 09:58.890
Don't you get it?

09:59.080 --> 10:00.890
We came for you.

10:01.600 --> 10:02.940
These disciples

10:02.990 --> 10:04.500
are just extras.

10:04.840 --> 10:06.090
The real prize

10:06.280 --> 10:07.650
is you!

10:11.590 --> 10:12.340
Mrs,

10:13.000 --> 10:14.930
Grandmaster Yunlu requests your presence.

10:16.070 --> 10:17.460
Please come with us.

10:18.640 --> 10:20.260
As for these disciples,

10:20.640 --> 10:21.980
since we are at war,

10:22.830 --> 10:23.890
I can't let them go.

10:24.190 --> 10:25.980
Apologies.

10:33.120 --> 10:34.170
In that case,

10:34.790 --> 10:35.650
let's fight!

10:39.310 --> 10:40.890
Break out the moment battle starts.

10:41.040 --> 10:42.170
Whoever escapes, escapes.

10:42.520 --> 10:44.290
Meet at the spot marked by the Soul-Burning Spell.

10:44.710 --> 10:45.770
Grandmaster!

10:48.310 --> 10:49.260
Go now.

10:49.590 --> 10:51.140
This fight isn't for you!

10:51.520 --> 10:52.140
Move!

10:52.790 --> 10:53.740
Qu Hun, move!

11:03.160 --> 11:04.620
Trying to run?

12:55.880 --> 12:57.140
Your opponent is here.

13:04.880 --> 13:06.460
Is this where it all ends?

13:07.070 --> 13:08.740
I hope Han Li and the others got out.

13:14.520 --> 13:15.810
We're almost there.

13:17.160 --> 13:18.020
We'll be safe once we're there.

13:20.830 --> 13:21.740
Han!

13:41.240 --> 13:42.050
Something's off.

13:42.640 --> 13:43.050
Be careful!

14:12.760 --> 14:14.220
This is clearly the meeting spot.

14:14.480 --> 14:15.860
Why are the demonic cultivators here?

14:16.400 --> 14:17.410
Where's the person sent to pick us up?

14:17.520 --> 14:18.740
There won't be anyone.

14:19.070 --> 14:19.690
Come with me!

14:31.160 --> 14:32.220
It's him!

14:36.670 --> 14:38.290
Oh, isn't that Li Feiyu?

14:38.830 --> 14:39.460
No.

14:41.190 --> 14:42.690
You're not Li Feiyu.

14:43.190 --> 14:44.050
Your name is...

14:45.000 --> 14:45.770
Han Li.

14:48.280 --> 14:50.980
No wonder I couldn't track you down.

14:56.590 --> 14:57.860
How did he know I'd be here?

15:02.280 --> 15:03.340
Not bad.

15:04.040 --> 15:05.340
You've got some skills.

15:06.830 --> 15:09.260
This makes killing you way more fun!

15:24.910 --> 15:26.050
A Core cultivator is here...

15:46.710 --> 15:47.380
Master!

15:52.400 --> 15:54.050
You're a lucky one, kid.

15:55.550 --> 15:56.890
You made me work so hard

15:57.000 --> 15:58.140
just to find you.

16:00.040 --> 16:00.740
Master,

16:01.280 --> 16:02.050
I finally found you.

16:04.240 --> 16:05.340
Where's your Mentor Hongfu?

16:06.040 --> 16:06.810
She told us

16:07.240 --> 16:08.690
to meet here.

16:09.160 --> 16:10.100
And she stayed behind

16:10.520 --> 16:11.740
to stall those demonic cultivators.

16:12.520 --> 16:13.220
Didn't expect

16:13.880 --> 16:15.140
we'd get ambushed too.

16:22.000 --> 16:22.860
I see.

16:24.480 --> 16:25.650
You've done well.

16:29.950 --> 16:30.460
Here.

16:32.190 --> 16:33.050
Take this.

16:34.950 --> 16:37.340
Some supplies and gems.

16:37.480 --> 16:39.770
If you run into your senior brothers and sisters,

16:40.000 --> 16:40.770
share these with them for me.

16:43.000 --> 16:43.690
Also this.

16:45.160 --> 16:45.810
This one

16:46.590 --> 16:47.460
is for you to keep.

16:47.460 --> 16:48.260
[Core Formation Notes]

16:48.360 --> 16:50.170
There are some insights from me.

16:50.590 --> 16:52.050
Read them when you're breaking through.

16:55.120 --> 16:56.050
Thanks for your guidance, Master.

16:56.190 --> 16:57.260
But I can't accept

16:58.950 --> 16:59.860
this mystic pouch.

17:01.790 --> 17:02.770
Please,

17:03.160 --> 17:04.170
give it to the others yourself

17:04.400 --> 17:06.020
once you return safely.

17:07.880 --> 17:09.530
What are you talking about?

17:10.120 --> 17:12.690
It's just some travel funds.

17:13.640 --> 17:14.740
Alright, enough.

17:15.040 --> 17:15.620
Next up

17:15.790 --> 17:17.170
is a battle between Core cultivators.

17:17.430 --> 17:18.500
With your current level,

17:18.640 --> 17:19.410
you won't be able to help at all.

17:20.120 --> 17:20.740
Hurry up

17:21.000 --> 17:21.860
and focus on healing.

17:22.120 --> 17:22.860
Remember,

17:23.400 --> 17:24.860
once you leave Yue Kingdom,

17:25.040 --> 17:26.290
the demonic sects won't be able to reach you.

17:26.790 --> 17:27.380
Got it?

17:30.360 --> 17:31.100
Master...

17:32.790 --> 17:33.690
do you really have to go?

17:34.430 --> 17:35.100
What?

17:36.040 --> 17:36.690
Go where?

17:39.120 --> 17:40.460
From what those demonic guys said,

17:41.550 --> 17:42.980
they may not want

17:43.670 --> 17:44.890
to kill Senior Hongfu.

17:45.710 --> 17:46.770
They seem to have a hidden motive.

17:49.360 --> 17:50.380
Please be extra careful.

17:52.830 --> 17:53.890
You kid...

17:54.430 --> 17:56.050
I can't hide anything, huh?

17:56.590 --> 17:57.140
Come on.

17:57.160 --> 17:57.860
Get up.

17:59.830 --> 18:00.620
Han Li,

18:01.790 --> 18:02.930
you haven't been here long,

18:03.760 --> 18:04.690
but you're smart,

18:05.070 --> 18:05.740
cautious,

18:06.000 --> 18:07.500
and know how to keep a low profile.

18:08.640 --> 18:09.770
One day,

18:10.160 --> 18:11.860
you may even surpass me.

18:14.790 --> 18:15.570
I know full well,

18:16.880 --> 18:17.570
this mission

18:17.830 --> 18:19.020
is incredibly dangerous.

18:19.240 --> 18:20.260
Odds are I won't make it back.

18:20.670 --> 18:22.740
But I have my reasons.

18:25.400 --> 18:26.570
The longer one lives,

18:27.040 --> 18:28.290
the more one realizes

18:29.040 --> 18:30.810
some things in this world

18:31.160 --> 18:32.810
matter more than your own life.

18:34.240 --> 18:35.100
Like...

18:36.550 --> 18:37.410
certain people.

18:44.790 --> 18:45.500
Give me your hand.

18:53.590 --> 18:55.290
I'll remove the Soul-Burning Spell

18:55.590 --> 18:56.370
for you.

18:57.040 --> 18:58.570
This settles our sect's debt to you.

19:00.240 --> 19:00.810
Alright.

19:02.240 --> 19:03.570
Leave Yue Kingdom quickly.

19:06.480 --> 19:08.330
There are many beautiful sights out there.

19:08.630 --> 19:10.330
Go see them for me.

19:15.790 --> 19:16.260
That's enough.

19:16.790 --> 19:17.290
I'm off now.

20:02.550 --> 20:03.260
We're alive?

20:07.150 --> 20:07.940
Where even are we?

20:10.040 --> 20:11.130
That guy's insane.

20:11.590 --> 20:12.610
Stick with him,

20:13.040 --> 20:14.370
and you'll end up dead sooner or later.

20:15.590 --> 20:16.330
What did you say?

20:16.630 --> 20:17.570
I didn't say anything!

20:18.870 --> 20:19.810
Just spitting out some sand.

20:21.630 --> 20:22.850
I meant, congrats, Young Master!

20:23.070 --> 20:25.090
You made it out alive against a Core cultivator!

20:26.390 --> 20:27.260
You're destined for great things!

20:28.390 --> 20:29.330
Any plans now?

20:29.630 --> 20:30.980
What plans can I have?

20:32.000 --> 20:33.290
Oh, I've got loads of ideas,

20:34.070 --> 20:34.940
but the big calls

20:35.310 --> 20:35.980
are up to you.

20:36.200 --> 20:37.530
You give the word, I'll follow.

20:39.070 --> 20:40.020
We'll head to Yellow Maple Valley

20:40.150 --> 20:41.050
and regroup with the Grandmaster.

20:41.520 --> 20:42.610
Han Li...

20:43.310 --> 20:45.460
I swear I'll kill you myself someday!

20:49.920 --> 20:50.810
What's wrong with you?

21:13.040 --> 21:15.330
You truly are the strongest woman of Yellow Maple Valley.

21:15.720 --> 21:17.700
Your strength is remarkable.

21:18.590 --> 21:19.730
Seems I'll have to

21:20.160 --> 21:21.780
give it everything I've got!

21:22.430 --> 21:24.100
Let's grab that woman first,

21:24.510 --> 21:25.980
then kill off the weaklings.

21:26.550 --> 21:28.100
Just leave her face intact.

21:28.350 --> 21:29.690
An arm or a leg missing

21:29.870 --> 21:31.650
doesn't matter.

21:32.510 --> 21:34.050
As you wish, my dear!

21:54.390 --> 21:55.980
You're strong enough,

21:56.200 --> 21:57.020
but unfortunately...

21:57.240 --> 21:58.660
this battle will be your last!

21:59.150 --> 21:59.660
Senior,

21:59.830 --> 22:00.460
I'm here with you!

22:12.920 --> 22:13.530
Senior,

22:14.390 --> 22:15.050
sorry I'm late!

22:16.040 --> 22:16.500
Hurry,

22:17.590 --> 22:18.370
take this pill

22:18.550 --> 22:19.180
and start healing.

22:21.280 --> 22:23.180
This is high-grade stuff from Wangyu?

22:23.790 --> 22:24.370
Yeah!

22:24.550 --> 22:26.090
One pill costs 2000 gems!

22:26.240 --> 22:27.370
Like swallowing money!

22:37.870 --> 22:39.420
I sent Han Li and the others ahead.

22:40.040 --> 22:41.180
I wonder how they're doing...

22:41.350 --> 22:42.290
I just saw him.

22:42.760 --> 22:43.290
Don't worry.

22:43.630 --> 22:44.460
That kid

22:44.550 --> 22:45.530
is not dying anytime soon.

23:01.480 --> 23:02.570
What about the other disciples?

23:02.790 --> 23:04.260
Did they all make it out of the valley?

23:06.870 --> 23:08.850
Grandmaster likely got them out.

23:09.110 --> 23:09.810
That guy

23:09.870 --> 23:10.980
met with Grandmaster.

23:12.150 --> 23:13.660
This was all part of their plan.

23:14.070 --> 23:15.660
Even the Soul-Burning Spell on us

23:15.680 --> 23:16.980
was part of it.

23:21.760 --> 23:22.850
I see...

23:24.040 --> 23:25.940
That's exactly his style.

23:27.440 --> 23:28.770
Still, trading me alone

23:29.440 --> 23:30.660
to save all of Yellow Maple Valley,

23:31.760 --> 23:32.940
that's a deal worth making.

23:44.480 --> 23:45.050
Senior,

23:45.760 --> 23:46.810
doesn't this feel

23:48.040 --> 23:50.090
just like when we first joined the sect?

23:50.440 --> 23:52.050
We snuck into Clear Void Sect for spirit herbs,

23:52.720 --> 23:54.460
and they sent a whole squad after us.

23:54.790 --> 23:56.090
The whole place was chaos!

23:58.550 --> 24:00.050
I still remember it clearly.

24:00.440 --> 24:01.610
There were also Junior Lei

24:01.920 --> 24:03.050
and Wangyu.

24:03.630 --> 24:04.370
We even knocked over

24:04.630 --> 24:06.530
a whole pot of pills

24:06.590 --> 24:07.740
Fu Yunzi was refining.

24:09.520 --> 24:10.500
Fu Yunzi cried over it

24:10.520 --> 24:11.900
for days!

24:12.790 --> 24:14.500
Like, hiding-under-the-blanket sobbing!

24:14.680 --> 24:16.130
That old gambling addict!

24:22.920 --> 24:24.570
This was from that fiend earlier.

24:26.240 --> 24:28.130
I think Fu Yunzi would want you to keep it.

24:38.200 --> 24:40.290
We messed around all our lives.

24:42.480 --> 24:44.090
But I doubt I'll ever get the chance

24:45.550 --> 24:46.610
to repay that favor.

24:52.000 --> 24:53.290
The Mountain Barrier's down...

25:00.110 --> 25:01.850
Yellow Maple Valley has fallen.

25:03.350 --> 25:04.180
You both

25:04.550 --> 25:05.850
aren't getting away either!

25:07.240 --> 25:08.090
Senior,

25:09.440 --> 25:10.330
do you think

25:10.440 --> 25:11.460
we'll get out of this one

25:11.550 --> 25:12.570
like we used to?

25:15.680 --> 25:16.700
These punks

25:17.040 --> 25:18.130
aren't even worth the effort!

25:18.920 --> 25:19.610
Junior,

25:20.240 --> 25:22.220
don't you dare steal my kills!

25:27.680 --> 25:29.740
It's a shame the sect's gone.

25:32.240 --> 25:33.420
As long as we live,

25:34.480 --> 25:35.610
the sect lives on.

25:47.350 --> 25:48.740
These bastards are noisy.

25:50.440 --> 25:51.660
Let Li Huayuan here

25:51.920 --> 25:53.090
clear the path for you.

25:53.870 --> 25:54.850
Time to go home!

27:05.550 --> 27:06.850
Congrats, Grandmaster.

27:07.760 --> 27:09.660
You finally wiped out Yellow Maple Valley.

27:16.520 --> 27:17.700
My Herbs Garden...

27:18.830 --> 27:20.940
That hasn't been yours for a long time.

27:22.150 --> 27:22.980
Everything below us now

27:23.590 --> 27:24.980
is dead.

27:26.040 --> 27:27.570
Besides, you've already joined our sect.

27:28.000 --> 27:29.090
You should've let go

27:29.520 --> 27:31.020
of these things long ago.

27:36.280 --> 27:37.740
If all that's left is scorched earth,

27:38.630 --> 27:40.020
what's the point of conquering it

27:41.480 --> 27:43.810
for the Joyful Union Sect?

27:44.760 --> 27:46.370
I've done as you asked

27:47.480 --> 27:49.570
and gave them as much mercy as I could.

27:50.440 --> 27:51.220
Wang Chan

27:52.280 --> 27:54.570
will handle this place.

27:56.440 --> 27:57.020
Grandmaster,

27:57.200 --> 27:58.850
I won't disappoint you!

27:59.310 --> 27:59.980
One more thing.

28:01.280 --> 28:02.570
Did you catch that leftover

28:03.070 --> 28:03.940
from the Seven Sects?

28:08.240 --> 28:08.980
Grandmaster...

28:10.110 --> 28:11.500
that brat's too lucky.

28:12.150 --> 28:13.330
I didn't expect

28:13.480 --> 28:15.660
he'd be rescued by a Core cultivator

28:16.150 --> 28:16.940
from Yellow Maple Valley.

28:22.240 --> 28:23.660
Even in a death trap like that,

28:24.310 --> 28:25.610
he still got away.

28:26.520 --> 28:28.610
Maybe his fate really hasn't run out yet.

28:30.390 --> 28:31.260
Does that mean...

28:32.830 --> 28:34.660
I'll have to deal with him myself?

28:35.760 --> 28:36.330
Grandmaster,

28:36.720 --> 28:37.290
please,

28:38.040 --> 28:39.220
there's no need for that!

28:40.200 --> 28:41.530
In cultivation,

28:42.280 --> 28:44.500
you need something to sharpen yourself.

28:45.870 --> 28:46.980
That boy

28:48.240 --> 28:49.570
is still yours to face.

28:53.070 --> 28:54.130
Rest assured, Grandmaster.

28:55.550 --> 28:56.530
He won't get far.

29:05.390 --> 29:07.330
I hope Han Li will make it out alive.

29:08.110 --> 29:10.020
I hope you won't get yourself killed.

29:11.590 --> 29:12.290
Looks like...

29:12.720 --> 29:14.660
he's become your inner demon.

29:15.310 --> 29:17.370
That'll seriously hinder your cultivation.

29:18.960 --> 29:19.700
Father...

29:20.150 --> 29:21.660
please don't kill him.

29:22.550 --> 29:24.370
Let him fight Wang Chan.

29:35.040 --> 29:36.050
Hubby...

29:45.350 --> 29:45.900
Darling!

30:22.070 --> 30:23.770
Our grandmaster's here.

30:24.350 --> 30:26.290
You're dead now!

30:31.040 --> 30:31.850
Grandmaster,

30:32.240 --> 30:33.740
that's the one who saved the boy.

30:33.830 --> 30:35.290
A Core cultivator from Yellow Maple Valley.

30:36.070 --> 30:36.700
Master...

30:37.350 --> 30:38.180
Mentor...

30:42.000 --> 30:43.020
Come back with me.

30:45.590 --> 30:46.370
Junior,

30:47.480 --> 30:48.460
go on ahead.

30:49.720 --> 30:50.660
At this point,

30:51.680 --> 30:53.050
death's the only outcome.

30:58.960 --> 31:00.900
Li Huayuan of Yellow Maple Valley

31:00.920 --> 31:02.290
is here!

31:03.000 --> 31:03.850
Let's see

31:04.150 --> 31:05.980
what Yunlu has to teach me!

31:07.000 --> 31:08.220
How foolish.

31:11.310 --> 31:12.900
Yellow Maple Valley is finished.

31:14.000 --> 31:15.660
But I'll honor my pact with Linghu.

31:16.390 --> 31:17.370
Hongfu stays.

31:18.550 --> 31:19.850
Everyone else must leave.

31:20.480 --> 31:21.570
Not leaving!

31:29.150 --> 31:31.570
You, a mighty Nascent Soul cultivator,

31:32.680 --> 31:34.850
won't even duel me one-on-one?

31:39.240 --> 31:40.260
Yunlu...

31:41.350 --> 31:41.980
Junior!

31:42.040 --> 31:43.900
Let's make a wager!

31:45.480 --> 31:46.810
If I can force you

31:47.150 --> 31:49.020
to make a move,

31:49.480 --> 31:50.740
then I win!

31:51.440 --> 31:52.980
And you'll have to

31:53.280 --> 31:54.770
let my senior go!

31:59.720 --> 32:00.500
Junior,

32:00.720 --> 32:01.460
don't be stupid.

32:01.720 --> 32:02.700
You're no match for him.

32:11.790 --> 32:13.020
My turn.

33:06.680 --> 33:07.290
Junior!

33:11.790 --> 33:13.460
Worthy of a Nascent Soul cultivator...

33:22.770 --> 33:24.020
After all these years,

33:25.240 --> 33:27.200
you're still cold as ever

33:27.760 --> 33:29.210
and won't change your mind?

33:29.480 --> 33:30.740
After all these years,

33:31.550 --> 33:33.370
you're still so arrogant.

33:34.310 --> 33:35.900
As if the world

33:36.720 --> 33:37.530
belongs to you alone.

33:39.000 --> 33:39.770
She's right.

33:40.350 --> 33:41.740
Dead right.

33:44.240 --> 33:45.770
People like you

33:46.590 --> 33:48.460
destroy homes and kill loved ones

33:49.480 --> 33:51.810
all for your own gain,

33:53.520 --> 33:55.700
then pretend you've done nothing wrong.

33:56.110 --> 33:57.810
Shameless!

33:59.240 --> 33:59.900
Mentor!

34:00.200 --> 34:00.980
Stop fighting!

34:01.200 --> 34:01.810
Mentor Li!

34:02.310 --> 34:02.850
Please!

34:03.760 --> 34:04.850
Please stop!

34:05.440 --> 34:06.290
Master...

34:07.790 --> 34:09.370
My mother will be okay.

34:11.150 --> 34:12.530
You have to treat your wounds now,

34:12.870 --> 34:14.290
before it's too late!

34:17.720 --> 34:18.420
Xuan'er...

34:19.550 --> 34:20.330
honestly...

34:21.920 --> 34:24.050
you looked better in your old clothes.

34:25.630 --> 34:26.370
Mentor...

34:31.960 --> 34:32.980
back in the day,

34:33.870 --> 34:35.420
there was this crusty old man.

34:36.590 --> 34:38.370
On my very first day in the sect,

34:38.390 --> 34:39.980
he taught me something.

34:40.920 --> 34:42.900
He said, in this world,

34:43.520 --> 34:45.660
the weak must bow their heads,

34:45.790 --> 34:46.770
but only the strong

34:47.070 --> 34:49.020
get to take what they want.

34:50.870 --> 34:52.180
Whether it's status,

34:52.830 --> 34:53.740
power,

34:54.110 --> 34:55.020
strength,

34:56.040 --> 34:57.900
or even someone else's life,

34:58.390 --> 34:59.460
if they want it,

34:59.630 --> 35:00.940
they take it.

35:02.440 --> 35:05.460
That's the iron law of this world.

35:06.280 --> 35:07.900
If you want to live long,

35:08.390 --> 35:10.290
you'd better understand that.

35:18.630 --> 35:21.260
But if that's all this world is,

35:22.960 --> 35:24.700
what's the point?

35:37.080 --> 35:37.980
He's shattering his own core

35:38.150 --> 35:39.130
to forcibly boost his power.

35:39.440 --> 35:40.060
Is he insane?

35:54.670 --> 35:56.210
For Yellow Maple Valley,

35:57.040 --> 35:58.570
take one more strike from me!

35:59.270 --> 36:00.860
You old bastard!

36:34.320 --> 36:35.780
Yunlu!

36:36.270 --> 36:38.570
I finally forced you to fight back!

36:40.670 --> 36:41.900
I win!

36:54.070 --> 36:54.980
Junior!

37:02.000 --> 37:02.690
Senior...

37:05.360 --> 37:06.530
we won.

37:12.550 --> 37:13.940
We can finally go home.

37:16.880 --> 37:17.690
Junior...

37:22.270 --> 37:23.300
My name's Hongfu.

37:23.480 --> 37:24.050
From now on,

37:24.190 --> 37:25.420
you better call me Senior.

37:27.320 --> 37:28.300
I'm Li Huayuan.

37:28.400 --> 37:29.380
Greetings, Senior.

37:30.740 --> 37:33.820
♪That day I first saw you...♪

37:35.630 --> 37:36.650
Junior...

37:39.220 --> 37:41.420
♪We made a promise to reunite...♪

37:41.440 --> 37:42.420
Mentor Li!

37:43.590 --> 37:44.460
Mentor Li...

37:47.920 --> 37:48.860
Mentor Li...

37:49.710 --> 37:50.420
He's gone...

37:51.220 --> 37:54.220
♪Only silence fills the space as we lock eyes...♪

37:54.750 --> 37:55.610
Master...

37:56.020 --> 37:57.900
♪We cherished each moment...♪

37:57.920 --> 37:58.730
Master...

37:59.520 --> 38:00.380
Mother!

38:02.590 --> 38:03.980
Mentor is gone.

38:04.320 --> 38:06.300
Come with us, please!

38:08.980 --> 38:12.380
♪So be it, I set myself free♪

38:12.860 --> 38:16.540
♪To be one standing tall and proud♪

38:17.100 --> 38:20.660
♪Never become a hollow shell...♪

38:22.840 --> 38:23.650
Xuan'er...

38:25.710 --> 38:27.090
you've grown up.

38:28.840 --> 38:29.940
From now on,

38:31.310 --> 38:32.570
you'll have to walk your path alone.

38:34.270 --> 38:34.940
Mother...

38:38.910 --> 38:39.800
Mother...

38:41.750 --> 38:42.530
Huayuan...

38:44.150 --> 38:45.380
We're going home now.

38:47.440 --> 38:48.210
Mother...

38:49.540 --> 38:53.060
♪Into this starry sky♪

38:53.540 --> 38:57.180
♪Starlight fades into the Milky Way♪

38:57.660 --> 39:01.300
♪While the mayfly dies in the whirlpool♪

39:01.820 --> 39:05.420
♪Fate raises a toast with song♪

39:06.060 --> 39:09.580
♪Playing the fleeting game of life♪

39:10.140 --> 39:13.700
♪Each step of fate's game unclear...♪

39:14.070 --> 39:14.780
Huayuan...

39:17.520 --> 39:18.340
We're going home.

39:18.340 --> 39:21.820
♪But my heart has never rested...♪

39:21.840 --> 39:22.900
You're really leaving me?

39:22.900 --> 39:26.020
♪Ever chasing, still searching on...♪

39:28.840 --> 39:30.210
Yellow Maple Valley is no more!

39:30.900 --> 39:34.260
♪How do I choose the way?♪

39:34.740 --> 39:38.380
♪Now we part, so far apart...♪

39:41.710 --> 39:42.340
No, please!

39:43.320 --> 39:43.980
No, please!

39:45.270 --> 39:46.020
No, please!

39:46.960 --> 39:48.020
No! Father!

39:59.070 --> 39:59.730
Father!

40:17.860 --> 40:22.060
♪I chase the years, but youth is long gone♪

40:22.700 --> 40:26.100
♪So be it, I set myself free♪

40:26.100 --> 40:26.580
[Li Huayuan]

40:26.580 --> 40:30.260
♪To be one standing tall and proud...♪

40:30.270 --> 40:31.300
Huayuan...

40:31.300 --> 40:34.420
♪Never become a hollow shell...♪

40:35.630 --> 40:36.570
Huayuan...

40:41.040 --> 40:42.570
In the end...

40:44.150 --> 40:45.460
I was wrong all along?

40:47.260 --> 40:50.100
♪Even though it mocks loudly♪

40:51.020 --> 40:54.460
♪We're just fleeting mortals♪

40:55.020 --> 40:58.620
♪Time slipped by before we knew♪

40:59.060 --> 41:02.660
♪Yet we burn that spark of light...♪

41:03.220 --> 41:06.780
♪Into this starry sky♪

41:07.340 --> 41:10.900
♪Starlight fades into the Milky Way♪

41:11.500 --> 41:15.020
♪While the mayfly dies in the whirlpool♪

41:15.780 --> 41:19.100
♪Fate raises a toast with song♪

41:19.740 --> 41:23.300
♪Playing the fleeting game of life♪

41:23.860 --> 41:27.420
♪Each step of fate's game unclear♪

41:28.220 --> 41:31.540
♪Who can guess the ending?♪

41:32.260 --> 41:35.620
♪But my heart has never rested♪

41:36.300 --> 41:39.740
♪Ever chasing, still searching on♪

41:40.260 --> 41:43.860
♪Through all the joy and sorrow♪

41:44.380 --> 41:47.980
♪How do I choose the way?♪

41:48.460 --> 41:52.020
♪Now we part, so far apart♪

41:52.900 --> 41:57.260
♪We'll walk our separate paths♪

41:57.260 --> 42:01.190
♪Farewell♪

42:01.490 --> 42:03.450
♪Farewell...♪

42:03.550 --> 42:05.090
Forget it.

42:06.750 --> 42:08.980
Whether you live or die

42:11.920 --> 42:14.570
has nothing to do with me anymore.

42:14.890 --> 42:18.170
♪Farewell...♪

42:20.140 --> 42:21.900
[Hongfu]

42:22.070 --> 42:26.350
♪Farewell♪

42:26.350 --> 42:30.760
♪Farewell♪

42:49.000 --> 42:49.860
Grandmaster!

42:50.110 --> 42:51.500
Urgent news from the outpost.

42:51.800 --> 42:52.780
Yellow Maple Valley

42:53.070 --> 42:54.530
has fallen to the demonic sects.

42:55.110 --> 42:56.460
What's the casualty report?

42:56.710 --> 42:57.730
Grandmaster Linghu

42:57.920 --> 42:59.730
has already retreated with the elite disciples.

43:00.040 --> 43:01.690
Core cultivator Li Huayuan

43:02.110 --> 43:03.020
died in battle.

43:03.520 --> 43:05.050
Cultivator Hongfu fled.

43:07.630 --> 43:09.020
Summon a team for me.

43:09.710 --> 43:10.780
I'm going to Yellow Maple Valley.

43:11.000 --> 43:11.380
But...

43:11.480 --> 43:11.900
What's wrong?

43:13.320 --> 43:14.980
Master gave me an order yesterday.

43:15.320 --> 43:16.730
You played a major role

43:16.960 --> 43:18.420
in this war against the demonic sects.

43:18.880 --> 43:19.780
But now,

43:19.960 --> 43:21.020
your injuries haven't healed.

43:21.150 --> 43:22.300
She asked me to tell you

43:22.360 --> 43:24.020
not to wear yourself out

43:24.040 --> 43:25.500
over such matters again.

43:26.040 --> 43:28.570
So, Senior is set on making peace with the demonic sects?

43:32.040 --> 43:32.860
Fine.

43:36.750 --> 43:37.690
What about

43:37.920 --> 43:38.940
the Foundation disciples

43:39.320 --> 43:40.380
and Qi Refining disciples

43:40.520 --> 43:41.050
from Yellow Maple Valley?

43:41.110 --> 43:42.420
Do we know where they are?

43:42.880 --> 43:44.050
During the retreat,

43:44.190 --> 43:45.730
they split into several groups.

43:45.960 --> 43:47.130
One of them

43:47.230 --> 43:48.690
was led by Hongfu.

43:49.150 --> 43:49.940
But along the way,

43:50.190 --> 43:51.900
they were ambushed by the demonic sects.

43:52.270 --> 43:53.530
Almost all of them

43:53.840 --> 43:55.210
were wiped out.

43:56.840 --> 43:58.050
Wiped out?

43:58.590 --> 43:59.900
No survivors?

44:00.110 --> 44:01.570
That's just a rumor.

44:01.960 --> 44:03.690
I'm not sure of the details.

44:07.360 --> 44:08.980
So... it's really time to build your monument?

44:10.480 --> 44:11.420
Spread the word.

44:12.000 --> 44:13.420
If any disciple of Yellow Maple Valley

44:14.590 --> 44:16.130
needs help,

44:17.190 --> 44:18.130
Moonshadow Sect will offer aid.

44:20.520 --> 44:21.780
I'll be going into secluded cultivation.

44:22.150 --> 44:23.170
No one is to disturb me

44:23.710 --> 44:24.940
without my permission.

44:25.630 --> 44:26.900
Yes, Grandmaster.

44:30.710 --> 44:32.250
If that brat really dies like this,

44:32.360 --> 44:33.610
it's too good for him.

44:34.270 --> 44:35.090
I need to go see for myself.

44:44.360 --> 44:45.210
Too bad...

44:45.840 --> 44:47.170
That's the power of a Core cultivator.

44:48.000 --> 44:49.530
Just a touch of that red mist,

44:49.960 --> 44:50.820
and I'm already injured inside.

45:19.580 --> 45:24.900
♪Shards of dreams inside a dream♪

45:26.140 --> 45:31.540
♪A pale moon falls into mirrored skies♪

45:31.660 --> 45:34.860
♪Years slipped by as I lingered on♪

45:35.100 --> 45:37.340
♪Old scenes rise again♪

45:37.740 --> 45:40.580
♪Too hard to forget♪

45:41.100 --> 45:45.060
♪Easier just to miss♪

45:45.900 --> 45:51.380
♪They say the past fades like smoke♪

45:52.540 --> 45:57.820
♪But looking back still stirs the ache♪

45:58.420 --> 46:01.460
♪This noisy world, this lonely page♪

46:01.740 --> 46:03.860
♪Swept away by time♪

46:04.500 --> 46:07.140
♪Eyes once looked far♪

46:07.620 --> 46:11.580
♪Now lost in the shift♪

46:12.060 --> 46:14.900
♪Autumn winds stir♪

46:15.180 --> 46:17.100
♪Smoke curls once more♪

46:17.540 --> 46:19.980
♪Like clouds on the edge of sky♪

46:20.300 --> 46:23.820
♪Returning to my eyes♪

46:24.380 --> 46:27.340
♪Looking back from the mountaintop♪

46:27.660 --> 46:30.580
♪Time lost its name♪

46:30.980 --> 46:33.820
♪Was it yesterday♪

46:34.220 --> 46:37.780
♪Or tomorrow?♪

46:38.140 --> 46:40.980
♪The world has changed♪

46:41.380 --> 46:43.220
♪Beyond recall♪

46:43.780 --> 46:45.500
♪Time will fade♪

46:45.900 --> 46:50.700
♪All the words ever spoken♪

46:51.380 --> 46:54.260
♪Only this longing remains♪

46:54.740 --> 47:00.020
♪Crossing centuries and days♪

47:01.140 --> 47:07.780
♪In a fleeting moment we call eternity♪

47:08.260 --> 47:17.980
♪In a fleeting moment called eternity♪
